# DMGAssist list: Holy Paladin damage between heals (learned from Method's guide, patch 12.1.5)
# Written by DMGAssist, not SimulationCraft. Build Holy Power, spend it on Shield of the Righteous when no
# healing is needed (Word of Glory / Light of Dawn stay the player's call). Consecration fills the gaps.
actions.precombat=snapshot_stats
actions=shield_of_the_righteous,if=holy_power>=5
actions+=/divine_toll
actions+=/holy_shock
actions+=/hammer_of_wrath
actions+=/judgment
actions+=/shield_of_the_righteous,if=holy_power>=3
actions+=/crusader_strike
actions+=/consecration,if=!consecration.up
